what is controlled components?
The controlled components are form elements whose input values are managed by React state.
For Example if i useState to store the input values such as username, and bind the state with input values, whenever user enters input
onChange detect the event and update the value with setter function

const[name,setName] = useState("")
return(
    <input type = "text"
    value = {name}
    onchange={(e)=>setName(e.target.value)}
    />
)

User types → onChange → setName() → React state updates → input updates

